 "question": "B. Is this measure already running in Southwest Finland wellbeing services county (or in the Tyks university hospital area that treats its patients)?\nA. Our model assumes no direct effect on patients for this measure. Instead: does a source you read document the problem it fixes?\nMeasure: Audit of treatment records (\"no treatment on record\"). Take 50 patients with no treatment on record and check the charts: were they untreated, or was drug treatment or radiotherapy given and not coded? Fix the coding. It treats no extra patient, but until it is done the county cannot tell a care gap from a recording gap.",
